---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About | gazza.ltd"
  description="What gazza.ltd is, how the tools work and the terms of using them. Free calculators that show their working, with nothing uploaded and no sign-up needed."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> › <span>About</span>
    </nav>

    <h1>About gazza.ltd</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">
      Free calculators and everyday tools, built to show their working.
    </p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What this is</h2>
      <p>
        gazza.ltd is a small, growing collection of single-purpose
        calculators and utilities — mortgages, word games, text tools, and
        more being added over time. Every tool is free, requires no
        sign-up, and runs entirely in your browser.
      </p>

      <h2>How the tools work</h2>
      <p>
        Each calculator explains the method it uses underneath the tool
        itself, with a worked example using real numbers, so you can check
        a result rather than just trust it. Nothing you type is sent
        anywhere or stored — see the <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy
        policy</a> for the full detail.
      </p>

      <h2>Terms of use</h2>
      <p>
        The calculators on this site are provided for general informational
        purposes only. They are not financial, legal, medical or
        professional advice, and results should be treated as estimates
        rather than guarantees. Formulas and reference data (such as tax
        bands or dictionary word lists) are kept as accurate and current as
        we can manage, but you should verify anything you're relying on for
        an important decision with a qualified professional or an official
        source.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site is provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. We aren't
        liable for decisions made using the figures these tools produce.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site is supported by display advertising, which is what keeps
        every tool free to use. See the <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy
        policy</a> for how advertising cookies work and how to opt out of
        personalised ads.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Spotted a bug, have a tool request, or found an error in a
        calculation? Email <a href="mailto:hello@gazza.ltd">hello@gazza.ltd</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
